                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;4.10.0 (2026-04-13)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;AddSecretClient&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;AddKeyedSecretClient&lt;/code&gt; extension methods on &lt;code&gt;IHostApplicationBuilder&lt;/code&gt; for registering &lt;code&gt;SecretClient&lt;/code&gt; via dependency injection using configuration-based setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added a JSON schema segment to the NuGet package that provides IntelliSense and validation for &lt;code&gt;SecretClientSettings&lt;/code&gt; configuration in &lt;code&gt;appsettings.json&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
